me",\n      "description": "Players see a director\'s image and must select the movies they directed from poster choices. Designed to be challenging.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#d505ff",\n    "secondary": "#f9f9fb",\n    "accent": "#0d0d0d"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "Homepage with login/signup prompt. After login, user chooses Hollywood or Kollywood section. Each section displays a list of available games. Each game has its own interactive UI: blurred poster with clues, video player for clips, four images grid, dialogue with poster choices, and director image with movie poster options. Points and progress are tracked per user."\n}'}",
